WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.726
The Mézard Parisi formula.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.197
Spins on a sparse random graph. The formula

3
00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:07.295
was long known as an upper bound.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.141
Delay each replica split by one level

5
00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:12.977
to prove the matching lower bound.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.365
Claimed: the formula is exact.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.846
Checked in Lean.
